    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not just a \"tough time\" though. it's more like a fundamental shift. like the light went out and it's never coming back. i look at my work and i see nothing. it's all just noise. i feel like i'm just haunting my own life, waiting for something to happen that i know isn't going to happen. it's just this constant, heavy nothingness.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
